 SeriesPage-module__zgaxnW__altTitles m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root" data-size="md" data-line-clamp="true">나 혼자 네크로맨서  |  ソロ降霊術  |  The Alone Necromancer </p><button style="--button-height:var(--button-height-compact-xs);--button-padding-x:var(--button-padding-x-compact-xs);--button-fz:var(--mantine-font-size-xs);--button-bg:var(--mantine-color-gray-light);--button-hover:var(--mantine-color-gray-light-hover);--button-color:var(--mantine-color-gray-light-color);--button-bd:calc(0.0625rem * var(--mantine-scale)) solid transparent" class="mantine-focus-auto mantine-active SeriesPage-module__zgaxnW__altTitlesButton m_77c9d27d mantine-Button-root m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root mantine-hidden-from-sm" data-variant="light" data-size="compact-xs" data-block="true" type="button"><span class="m_80f1301b mantine-Button-inner"><span class="m_811560b9 mantine-Button-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-chevron-down "><path d="M6 9l6 6l6 -6"></path></svg></span></span></button><button style="--ai-bg:var(--mantine-color-gray-light);--ai-hover:var(--mantine-color-gray-light-hover);--ai-color:var(--mantine-color-gray-light-color);--ai-bd:calc(0.0625rem * var(--mantine-scale)) solid transparent;font-size:var(--mantine-font-size-md)" class="mantine-focus-auto mantine-active m_8d3f4000 mantine-ActionIcon-root m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root mantine-visible-from-sm" data-variant="light" type="button"><span class="m_8d3afb97 mantine-ActionIcon-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-chevron-right "><path d="M9 6l6 6l-6 6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div style="--badge-height:var(--badge-height-lg);--badge-padding-x:var(--badge-padding-x-lg);--badge-fz:var(--badge-fz-lg);--badge-radius:var(--mantine-radius-md);--badge-bg:transparent;--badge-color:var(--mantine-color-green-outline);--badge-bd:calc(0.0625rem * var(--mantine-scale)) solid var(--mantine-color-green-outline);margin-top:var(--mantine-spacing-xs)" class="m_347db0ec mantine-Badge-root" data-variant="outline" data-size="lg"><span class="m_5add502a mantine-Badge-label">Ongoing</span></div><div style="height:var(--mantine-spacing-sm);min-height:var(--mantine-spacing-sm)" class=""></div><div><p style="--text-line-clamp:10" class="mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root" data-line-clamp="true">The world is ending. Monsters from legends appear everywhere. They eat people, conquer the streets, and begin to make dungeons in the buildings and subways. If you could choose one job in this decrepit world, what would you choose? For a &quot;necromancer&quot; extinction is my playground and death my wealth.</p></div><div style="--group-gap:var(--mantine-spacing-xs);--group-align:center;--group-justify:apart;--group-wrap:wrap;margin-top:var(--mantine-spacing-sm)" class="m_4081bf90 mantine-Group-root"><a href="/genre/Action"><div style="--badge-height:var(--badge-height-lg);--badge-padding-x:var(--badge-padding-x-lg);--badge-fz:var(--badge-fz-lg);--badge-radius:var(--mantine-radius-md);--badge-bg:transparent;--badge-color:var(--mantine-color-red-outline);--badge-bd:calc(0.0625rem * var(--mantine-scale)) solid var(--mantine-color-red-outline)" class="SeriesPage-module__zgaxnW__badge m_347db0ec mantine-Badge-root" data-variant="outline" data-size="lg"><span class="m_5add502a mantine-Badge-label">Action</span></div></a><a href="/genre/Adventure"><div style="--badge-height:var(--badge-height-lg);--badge-padding-x:var(--badge-padding-x-lg);--badge-fz:var(--badge-fz-lg);--badge-radius:var(--mantine-radius-md);--badge-bg:transparent;--badge-color:var(--mantine-color-red-outline);--badge-bd:calc(0.0625rem * var(--mantine-scale)) so